Read through 7-Zip 25.01 or newer, list and extract: turned off in Settings
  wim      WIM image                  .wim .esd .swm
  chm      CHM help file              .chm
  msi      Windows Installer package  .msi .msp .msm
  nsis     NSIS installer             (an installer program)
  vhdx     VHDX disk image            .vhdx
  vhd      VHD disk image             .vhd
  vmdk     VMDK disk image            .vmdk
  qcow2    QCOW2 disk image           .qcow2 .qcow
  vdi      VDI disk image             .vdi
  fat      FAT image                  .img .ima
  ntfs     NTFS image                 .img
  ext      ext2/3/4 image             .img .ext2 .ext3 .ext4
  hfs      HFS+ image                 .hfs .hfsx
  apfs     APFS image                 .apfs
  cramfs   CramFS image               .cramfs .img
  gpt      GPT disk image             .img .raw
  mbr      MBR disk image             .img .raw
  zip methods: store, deflate (1-9, 6), bzip2 (1-9, 9), zstd (1-22, 3), xz (0-9, 6), ppmd (1-9, 7)
  7z methods: lzma2 (0-9, 5), lzma (0-9, 5), ppmd (1-9, 6), bzip2 (1-9, 9), deflate (1-9, 6), copy
  cab methods: store, mszip
  squashfs methods: gzip (1-9, 9), xz (0-9, 6), zstd (1-22, 15), lz4, lzo

